{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13402","headline":"西陵口观海 · 薛据","name":"西陵口观海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长江漫汤汤，近海势弥广。\n在昔胚浑凝，融爲百川泱。\n地形失端倪，天色灒滉漾。\n东南际万里，极目远无象。\n山影乍浮沈，潮波忽来往。\n孤帆或不见，櫂歌犹想像。\n日暮长风起，客心空振荡。\n浦口霞未收，潭心月初上。\n林屿几邅回，亭臯时偃仰。\n岁晏访蓬瀛，真游非外奖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛据","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}